        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an adventurer who has fallen into a sinkhole during your exploration.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the place you’ve landed is <i>not your Universe</i>, but another one.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape this strange place and begin your journey back home.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VERSE-JUMP</strong> to another Universe...</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994420/extras/7e14af2bd7d770c79fe4cd726e36b698.poster.avif?t=1758711370\" width=752 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994420/extras/7e14af2bd7d770c79fe4cd726e36b698.webm?t=1758711370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994420/extras/7e14af2bd7d770c79fe4cd726e36b698.mp4?t=1758711370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...with this technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the multiverse: same space, different reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dead end...?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994420/extras/24352b2ea33ba631626ce83c6c598107.poster.avif?t=1758711370\" width=752 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994420/extras/24352b2ea33ba631626ce83c6c598107.webm?t=1758711370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994420/extras/24352b2ea33ba631626ce83c6c598107.mp4?t=1758711370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But what about another universe? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s always a way—if not in this world, then in the next.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Casual Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994420/extras/da54f5c446d3c10914a98b032e31bbe1.poster.avif?t=1758711370\" width=752 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994420/extras/da54f5c446d3c10914a98b032e31bbe1.webm?t=1758711370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994420/extras/da54f5c446d3c10914a98b032e31bbe1.mp4?t=1758711370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994420/extras/7c4a8f9409330ae31b1148885d573c5a.poster.avif?t=1758711370\" width=752 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994420/extras/7c4a8f9409330ae31b1148885d573c5a.webm?t=1758711370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994420/extras/7c4a8f9409330ae31b1148885d573c5a.mp4?t=1758711370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Control System</strong> - <i>&quot;Move, Jump and <strong>VERSE-JUMP</strong>. That's all.&quot;</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auto Save System</strong> - <i>&quot;Checkpoint Reached!&quot;</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In-game Clear Timer </strong>- <i>&quot;My record is 25 minutes :)&quot;</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collectible Object </strong>- <i>&quot;Sucked into a Bagel&quot;</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short Playtime</strong> - <i>“Main clear: ~<strong>30 minutes</strong>; 100% completion: ~<strong>60 minutes</strong> (varies by skill and route).”</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stay Calm</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994420/extras/c0ae0c70e61138b97ab93f431fa68af9.poster.avif?t=1758711370\" width=752 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994420/extras/c0ae0c70e61138b97ab93f431fa68af9.webm?t=1758711370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994420/extras/c0ae0c70e61138b97ab93f431fa68af9.mp4?t=1758711370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Verse Jumper</strong> is a casual 3D platformer.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But remember: every path you take is always connected to another world.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move carefully and stay calm—  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >otherwise, the moment you jump, there may be no ground to land on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Wishing you a safe return!</strong></i> 👍</p>",
