ot;</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short Playtime</strong> - <i>“Main clear: ~<strong>30 minutes</strong>; 100% completion: ~<strong>60 minutes</strong> (varies by skill and route).”</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stay Calm</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994420/extras/c0ae0c70e61138b97ab93f431fa68af9.poster.avif?t=1758711370\" width=752 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994420/extras/c0ae0c70e61138b97ab93f431fa68af9.webm?t=1758711370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994420/extras/c0ae0c70e61138b97ab93f431fa68af9.mp4?t=1758711370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Verse Jumper</strong> is a casual 3D platformer.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But remember: every path you take is always connected to another world.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move carefully and stay calm—  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >otherwise, the moment you jump, there may be no ground to land on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Wishing you a safe return!</strong></i> 👍</p>",
